'''Crazed Titan Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by completing the event stage [[Crazy Cats (Insane)|The Crazed Titan]] appearing on the '''27th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases health and [[Wave Attack]] chance. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], you can get him from [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]] after completing [[Cosmic Lounge (Cats of the Cosmos)|Cosmic Club]] in Ch. 3 Interstellar Invasion. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], the stage of where you can obtain this unit appears every '''Friday'''.

