==Trivia==
*Manic Jamiera Cat is tied with [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]] and [[Chicken Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Rooster Cat]] for the highest Wave attack level out of any Cat unit, at 10.
*Prior to [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]]:
**The second line of Crazed M. Titan Cat's description was "Extreme attack power and health.".
**Manic Jamiera Cat's description mentioned how "[none] could outrun his godspeed", despite being no faster than his previous forms. This may have been in comparison to his [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Normal counterpart]], however, who does indeed move slower.
*Prior to [[Version 15.6 Update|Version 15.6]], Crazed Titan Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Crazed Titan Cat
Blessed with extreme attack power
and ridiculous amounts of health.
Area Attacks have a small chance to unleash Wave afar.</pre>
